# Binary formats, declared explicitly.
#
# This repo is worked on with core.autocrlf=true, and Git's own text/binary
# guess is only a heuristic: a PDF that happens to contain no NUL bytes is
# taken for text, and committing it strips every CR byte. That silently
# corrupted a submission PDF once (25841 bytes on disk, 25590 in the blob),
# which is why these are listed rather than left to the guess.

*.pdf    binary
*.docx   binary
*.doc    binary
*.pptx   binary
*.xlsx   binary
*.apk    binary
*.aab    binary
*.jar    binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks    binary

*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.webp   binary
*.ico    binary
*.svgz   binary

*.woff   binary
*.woff2  binary
*.ttf    binary
*.otf    binary
*.eot    binary

*.so     binary
*.dll    binary
*.dylib  binary
*.pdb    binary
*.zip    binary
*.gz     binary
*.7z     binary
